Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 01:00:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Refresh Zombie Survival to the build with touch controls

The game now plays on phones and tablets: a move stick, drag anywhere to
look, and buttons for attack, aim, use, jump, crouch, reload, swap, light,
bag and pause. The page's notice on touch devices used to say there were no
touch controls; it now tells the player to turn the phone sideways and use
Full screen, which is how the controls fit. This build also brings food
spoilage and cooking, and each item's real-world history in the bag.

Checked in iPhone 14 and Pixel 7 emulation against the files served from
public/zombie-survival/: the game starts, the touch controls appear, and no
errors are thrown. Real Safari still needs a check on a device.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
